flowchart TB
  request["Your request: transcribed speech or typed text"] --> core
  core["Core = application software; routing, context and orchestration"] -->|Request and context| main["Main model: reasoning, tools and answer"]
  main --> response["Answer text and optional speech"]
  core -->|Bounded decision request| jev["Decision model: Jev or configured alternative; commands, vocabulary, profile routing and explicit skill decisions"]
  jev -->|Decision result; Core routes or executes| core
  core -->|Memory, summary or explicit inexpensive job| support["Support model; separate from Main and Jev"]
  support -->|Facts and summaries used in context| core
  main -->|Tool request via Core interfaces| tools["Tools and skills"]
  tools -->|Returned data via Core interfaces| main
  note["Not every request invokes every role. A preselected command may still need a Main acknowledgement. Image-capable Main can read supplied screenshots."]

